    <string name="dict_calculated_value">Calculated Value: %1$d/100</string>
    <string name="dict_buy_score_def">This Trade Score aggregates human emotion (Fear &amp; Greed, Put/Call Ratios) and mathematical over-extensions (RSI, SMA Distance) into a single 0–100 value to detect market capitulation.</string>
    <string name="dict_buy_score_read">The higher the score, the better the buying opportunity because the crowd is panicking. The lower the score, the higher the risk of a severe pullback because the crowd is euphoric and greedy.</string>

